  "title": "Egg Yolk Tartare",
  "blurb": "A simple raw preparation of egg yolks dressed with capers, shallots and olive oil, served with pepper.",
  "steps": [
    "Rinse the capers under cold water and pat them dry, then chop them finely.",
    "Peel and finely chop the shallots.",
    "Separate the eggs and place two yolks on each serving plate, keeping them whole.",
    "Scatter the chopped capers and shallots around the yolks on each plate.",
    "Drizzle the olive oil over the yolks and season with black pepper to taste."
